=\frac{L^3}{3\pi^2}
\left(\frac{2m_e\varepsilon}{\hbar^2}\right)^{3/2}
\]
に代入し、\(\varepsilon\) で微分すれば、
\[
\boxed{
D(\varepsilon)
=\frac{L^3}{2\pi^2}
\left(\frac{2m_e}{\hbar^2}\right)^{3/2}
\sqrt{\varepsilon}
}
\]
\[
N=\int_0^{\varepsilon_F}D(\varepsilon)\dd\varepsilon
=\frac{L^3}{3\pi^2}
\left(\frac{2m_e\varepsilon_F}{\hbar^2}\right)^{3/2}
\]
より、
\[
\boxed{
\varepsilon_F
=\frac{\hbar^2}{2m_e}
